:"Interaction_PinchView","kind":"identifier"}],"url":"\/documentation\/swami\/interaction_pinchview","title":"Interaction_PinchView","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/Interaction_PinchView","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Pinch to scale a shape. A magnification (pinch) gesture drives an "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"origami.PopSwitch"},{"type":"text","text":" whose"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"state feeds the shape’s Transform Scale ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"builtin.point3D"},{"type":"text","text":"); releasing the pinch “pops” the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"switch to its nearest state with a spring. At rest a white triangle sits at its base scale on"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the magenta artboard."}],"type":"topic"},"doc://samatwork.Swami/documentation/Swami/Interaction_PinchView/accessibilityAction(named:_:)-427hr":{"kind":"symbol","abstract":[],"role":"symbol","title":"accessibilityAction(named:_:)","url":"\/documentation\/swami\/interaction_pinchview\/accessibilityaction(named:_:)-427hr","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"accessibilityAction"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"named"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI18LocalizedStringKeyV","text":"LocalizedStringKey"},{"kind":"text","text":", () -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:s4Voida","text":"Void"},{"kind":"text","text":") -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI15ModifiedContentV","text":"ModifiedContent"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Self"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI31AccessibilityAttachmentModifierV","text":"AccessibilityAttachmentModifier"},{"kind":"text","text":">"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/Interaction_PinchView\/accessibilityAction(named:_:)-427hr","type":"topic"},"doc://samatwork.Swami/documentation/Swami":{"role":"collection","kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"An Origami → SwiftUI translator: a deterministic parser reads Facebook’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".origami"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"patch graph into a semantic IR, and a codegen writes that IR out as SwiftUI. Swami"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"is also the patch-matched helper library that fills gaps between Origami patches"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and native SwiftUI — one helper per Origami patch, named after the patch, sized by"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Origami’s patch surface. Every pattern that lands is a deliverable, verified against"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Origami’s own render, and shipped as a DocC-embedded example."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami","url":"\/documentation\/swami","type":"topic","title":"Swami"}}}